msgid:
Hi {donor_name},

Open your donor portal:
{portal_url}

This link works for {link_expiry} and can only be used once. If you didn't request it, you can ignore this email.

Thanks,
{organisation_name}

msgstr:
Hola, {donor_name}:

Abre tu portal del donante:
{portal_url}

Este enlace funciona durante {link_expiry} y solo se puede usar una vez. Si no lo has solicitado, puedes ignorar este correo electrónico.

Gracias,
{organisation_name}

msgid:
Hi {donor_first_name},

Your next recurring donation of {amount} to {campaign_title} has been skipped. Nothing will be charged this time, and the donation continues on {next_payment_at}.

You can manage it any time here:
{portal_url}

Thanks,
{organisation_name}

msgstr:
Hola, {donor_first_name}:

Tu próxima donación recurrente de {amount} a {campaign_title} se ha omitido. Esta vez no se cobrará nada, y la donación continuará el {next_payment_at}.

Puedes gestionarla cuando quieras aquí:
{portal_url}

Gracias,
{organisation_name}

msgid:
Hi {donor_first_name},

Your recurring donation of {amount} to {campaign_title} has restarted. Your next payment is due on {next_payment_at}.

You can manage it any time here:
{portal_url}

Thanks,
{organisation_name}

msgstr:
Hola, {donor_first_name}:

Tu donación recurrente de {amount} a {campaign_title} se ha reanudado. Tu próximo pago está previsto para el {next_payment_at}.

Puedes gestionarla cuando quieras aquí:
{portal_url}

Gracias,
{organisation_name}

msgid:
Hi {donor_first_name},

Your recurring donation of {amount} to {campaign_title} has been paused. Nothing will be charged until it restarts on {resumes_at}.

You can restart it sooner, or stop it altogether, here:
{portal_url}

Thanks,
{organisation_name}

msgstr:
Hola, {donor_first_name}:

Tu donación recurrente de {amount} a {campaign_title} se ha puesto en pausa. No se cobrará nada hasta que se reanude el {resumes_at}.

Puedes reanudarla antes, o detenerla del todo, aquí:
{portal_url}

Gracias,
{organisation_name}

msgid:
Hi {donor_first_name},

Your recurring donation of {amount} to {campaign_title} was taken {old_frequency}. It will now be taken {frequency}, starting with the payment after your current one.

If that is not what you expected, you can change it back or stop the donation here:
{portal_url}

Thanks,
{organisation_name}

msgstr:
Hola, {donor_first_name}:

Tu donación recurrente de {amount} a {campaign_title} se cobraba {old_frequency}. A partir de ahora se cobrará {frequency}, empezando por el pago siguiente al actual.

Si no es lo que esperabas, puedes volver a la frecuencia anterior o detener la donación aquí:
{portal_url}

Gracias,
{organisation_name}

msgid:
Hi {donor_first_name},

Your recurring donation to {campaign_title} has been changed from {old_amount} to {amount}, starting with your next payment.

If that is not what you expected, you can change it back or stop the donation here:
{portal_url}

Thanks,
{organisation_name}

msgstr:
Hola, {donor_first_name}:

Tu donación recurrente a {campaign_title} ha pasado de {old_amount} a {amount}, a partir de tu próximo pago.

Si no es lo que esperabas, puedes volver al importe anterior o detener la donación aquí:
{portal_url}

Gracias,
{organisation_name}

msgid:
Hi {donor_name},

Your recurring donation of {amount} to {campaign_title} was renewed today.

Reference: {reference}

Thank you for your continued support.

Thanks,
{organisation_name}

msgstr:
Hola, {donor_name}:

Tu donación recurrente de {amount} a {campaign_title} se ha renovado hoy.

Referencia: {reference}

Te agradecemos que sigas apoyándonos.

Gracias,
{organisation_name}

msgid:
Hi {donor_first_name},

We have received your payment of {amount}.

Reference: {reference}

Your payment is being processed. Bank settlement can take a few business days; we will confirm as soon as it clears.

Thanks,
{organisation_name}

msgstr:
Hola, {donor_first_name}:

Hemos recibido tu pago de {amount}.

Referencia: {reference}

Tu pago se está procesando. La liquidación bancaria puede tardar unos días hábiles; te lo confirmaremos en cuanto se complete.

Gracias,
{organisation_name}

msgid:
Hi {donor_name},

Thank you. Your payment of {amount} is not complete yet.

{instructions}

Please transfer the amount using the reference {reference}. We will confirm as soon as the payment arrives.

{bank_details}

Thanks,
{organisation_name}

msgstr:
Hola, {donor_name}:

Gracias. Tu pago de {amount} aún no se ha completado.

{instructions}

Por favor, haz la transferencia del importe indicando la referencia {reference}. Te lo confirmaremos en cuanto llegue el pago.

{bank_details}

Gracias,
{organisation_name}

msgid:
Hi {donor_first_name},

We have received your donation of {amount}.

Reference: {reference}

Your payment is being processed. Bank settlement can take a few business days; we will email your receipt the moment it clears.

Thanks,
{organisation_name}

msgstr:
Hola, {donor_first_name}:

Hemos recibido tu donación de {amount}.

Referencia: {reference}

Tu pago se está procesando. La liquidación bancaria puede tardar unos días hábiles; te enviaremos el recibo por correo electrónico en cuanto se complete.

Gracias,
{organisation_name}

msgid:
Hi {donor_name},

Thank you for choosing to support {campaign_title} with a donation of {amount}.

{instructions}

Please transfer the amount using the reference {reference}. We will email your receipt as soon as the payment arrives.

{bank_details}

Thanks,
{organisation_name}

msgstr:
Hola, {donor_name}:

Gracias por decidir apoyar {campaign_title} con una donación de {amount}.

{instructions}

Por favor, haz la transferencia del importe indicando la referencia {reference}. Te enviaremos el recibo por correo electrónico en cuanto llegue el pago.

{bank_details}

Gracias,
{organisation_name}

msgid:
Hi {donor_first_name},

Thank you for your donation of {amount} to {organisation_name}.

Reference: {reference}
Receipt number: {receipt_number}

Your receipt is attached as a PDF. Keep it for your records.

With gratitude,
{organisation_name}

msgstr:
Hola, {donor_first_name}:

Gracias por tu donación de {amount} a {organisation_name}.

Referencia: {reference}
Número de recibo: {receipt_number}

Tu recibo va adjunto en PDF. Consérvalo para tus archivos.

Con gratitud,
{organisation_name}
